# Visual Crossing Weather API key.
# Get a free key: https://www.visualcrossing.com/weather-api
#
# Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the browser bundle.
# Prefer entering the key in the app UI for local use - that keeps it out of
# the build entirely. This file is for build-time / CI deployments.
#
# 1. Copy this file:  cp .env.example .env
# 2. Add your key below (without quotes)
VITE_VISUAL_CROSSING_API_KEY=your_visual_crossing_api_key_here
